                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "What you see in the screenshots is the entire game. There is no depth, it's just RNG events and memorizing the correct answers to the them. The second campaign is that, plus a bit more RNG. I had genuinely hoped this would have any sort of meta progression or meaningful content that would unlock, but there's absolutely nothing beyond what you can see in the screenshots. Maybe play it if it's free, but it's basically just a tech demo that got shipped as a full product.",
